# =============================================================================
# .gitignore: PT payment & market analysis
# =============================================================================
# Design intent, so a future reader doesn't have to guess why something is here:
#
#   KEPT in the repo      data/pt_geo_2024.csv  (0.24 MB, the PT service-line extract)
#                         scripts/, notebooks/, outputs/, figures/, README.md
#   DROPPED from the repo data/raw/*            (42 MB CMS source, re-downloadable)
#                         data/*.db             (built by scripts/build_db.py)
#                         notes/                (personal notes + explainers)
#
# The committed CSV is deliberate: it lets a reviewer run build_db.py and
# analyze.py without a 42 MB download. See the README's Data section.
# =============================================================================


# --- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.python-version


# --- Jupyter ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Notebook *outputs* are committed on purpose (so the notebook reads without a
# runtime), but checkpoints and execution copies are not.
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.nbconvert.ipynb
jupyter_execute/


# --- Large raw data and built databases -------------------------------------
# data/raw/ holds the full 42 MB CMS Public Use File. It is re-created on demand
# by scripts/fetch_data.py, so there is no reason to carry it in git history.
data/raw/
*.part

# data/pt_market.db is generated by scripts/build_db.py from the committed CSV.
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Do NOT ignore the committed extract:
!data/pt_geo_2024.csv


# --- Personal working notes (not portfolio material) ------------------------
# notes/ holds TUTORIAL.md (how the project was built) and EXPLAINERS.md (the
# reasoning behind each decision). Both are written for me, not for a reviewer,
# so they stay out of the published repo.
notes/
NOTES.md
TODO.md
scratch/
*.local.md
*~$*


# --- OS and editor cruft ----------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/
